#: ../../source/docs/sub-companions-computers.rst:5
#: 8c694ade5458452d967fa10e3798b42b
msgid "Companion Computers for Sub"
msgstr "Sub 的伴侣计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-companions-computers.rst:7
#: 4b0226a487de42d19835337c51360834
msgid ""
"Underwater ROVs often employ a small companion computer, in addition to the "
":ref:`ArduPilot autopilot <common-autopilots>` to manage video cameras and "
"sophisticated peripherals like SideScan Sonar as an adjunct to ArduPilot's "
"basic vehicle control and mission execution functions. Companion computers "
"communicate with the autopilot over a fast link, often a UART, using MAVLink"
" messages."
msgstr ""
"水下机器人通常在 :ref:`ArduPilot 飞控 <common-autopilots>` "
"之外还配备一台小型伴侣计算机，用于管理摄像头及旁扫声纳等复杂外设，作为 ArduPilot "
"基本飞行器控制和任务执行功能的补充。伴侣计算机通过快速链路（通常是 UART）使用 MAVLink 消息与飞控通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-companions-computers.rst:9
#: 3a218d48f2bd4abd9d106c8366e961c9
msgid ""
"ArduPilot compatible companion computers are listed :ref:`HERE <companion-"
"computers>`."
msgstr "与 ArduPilot 兼容的伴侣计算机列表见 :ref:`此处 <companion-computers>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sub-companions-computers.rst:11
#: 1d8f3983c032480480454a028f24bea0
msgid ""
"`Blue Robotics <https://bluerobotics.com/>`__ offers a highly functional, "
"open source, companion computer firmware system that runs on a Raspberry Pi "
"3, 4, or 5 <https://www.raspberrypi.com/products/raspberry-pi-3-model-b/>`__"
" for vehicles called `BlueOS "
"<https://blueos.cloud/docs/latest/usage/overview/>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Blue Robotics <https://bluerobotics.com/>`__ "
"为水下机器人提供了一套功能强大的开源伴侣计算机固件系统，可运行于 Raspberry Pi 3、4 或 5 "
"<https://www.raspberrypi.com/products/raspberry-pi-3-model-b/>`__，名为 `BlueOS"
" <https://blueos.cloud/docs/latest/usage/overview/>`__。"
